<title>FRANCE: Rhone to tender CFPI stake to Fernz.</title>
<headline>Rhone to tender CFPI stake to Fernz.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French drugs and chemicals company Rhone-Poulenc said on Monday it would tender its 32 percent stake in agricultural and industrial chemicals firm Cie Francaise des Produits Industriels (CFPI) to Fernz-Nufarm.</p>
<p>&quot;Under the terms of the agreement concluded with Fernz-Nufarm, Rhone-Poulenc Agro will tender its 32 percent stake in CFPI to the public tender offer announced by Fernz-Nufarm,&quot; Rhone-Poulenc said in a statement.</p>
</text>
